<title>USA: Xanthus seeks to buy Active Apparel stake.</title>
<headline>Xanthus seeks to buy Active Apparel stake.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xanthus Capital LP said it will seek to buy up to six percent of Active Apparel Group Inc's common stock in open market purchases from time to time.</p>
<p>Xanthus Capital LP, a merchant bank, said it expects to begin such purchases during the next two weeks and to continue to make purchases from time to time thereafter.</p>
</text>
